  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:01.390" end="00:08.110" ttm:agent="v1">Darling, take my hand</p>
      <p begin="00:08.110" end="00:14.130" ttm:agent="v1">Put it in yours, can I have this dance?</p>
      <p begin="00:14.130" end="00:18.770" ttm:agent="v1">When I touch her</p>
      <p begin="00:18.770" end="00:22.660" ttm:agent="v1">I want her</p>
      <p begin="00:22.660" end="00:28.890" ttm:agent="v1">Need her, love her</p>
      <p begin="00:28.890" end="00:33.720" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, uh, well, won't you dance</p>
      <p begin="00:33.720" end="00:41.590" ttm:agent="v1">In slow motion? Uh, slow motion, ooh</p>
      <p begin="00:41.590" end="00:48.380" ttm:agent="v1">You're a ba-ba-baby, oh, let's romance</p>
      <p begin="00:48.380" end="00:56.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">In slow motion (yeah), slow motion</p>
      <p begin="00:56.740" end="00:59.060" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:59.060" end="01:05.730" ttm:agent="v1">Darling, don't let go</p>
      <p begin="01:05.730" end="01:11.430" ttm:agent="v1">Look in my eyes, and you'll find my soul</p>
      <p begin="01:11.430" end="01:18.550" ttm:agent="v1">I've been struck by your love, like it's lightning from above</p>
      <p begin="01:18.550" end="01:25.770" ttm:agent="v1">There ain't nothing, nothing that I cannot feel, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:25.770" end="01:30.860" ttm:agent="v1">When I touch her</p>
      <p begin="01:30.860" end="01:34.790" ttm:agent="v1">I want her</p>
      <p begin="01:34.790" end="01:40.680" ttm:agent="v1">Need her, love her</p>
      <p begin="01:40.680" end="01:45.830" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, oh, won't you dance</p>
      <p begin="01:45.830" end="01:53.830" ttm:agent="v1">In slow motion? Yeah, in slow motion</p>
      <p begin="01:53.970" end="02:00.300" ttm:agent="v1">You're a ba-ba-baby, oh, let's romance</p>
      <p begin="02:00.300" end="02:05.870" ttm:agent="v1">In slow mo-, slow motion</p>
